      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Exercício 3 – Variância e Desvio Padrão\n",
        "\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "Uma fábrica mede o peso (em kg) de um lote de produtos:\n",
        "\n",
        "```Python\n",
        "pesos = [1.2, 1.3, 1.5, 1.7, 1.9, 2.0 ]\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "📌 Passos:  \n",
        "1. Calcule a média dos pesos.\n",
        "2. Determine a variância amostral.\n",
        "3. Calcule o desvio padrão amostral."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "jAe3d7bZEnKM"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "pesos = [1.2, 1.3, 1.5, 1.7, 1.9, 2.0 ]"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "fsciuRLgNG6m"
      },
      "execution_count": 35,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "## 1. Calcule a média dos pesos\n",
        "\n",
        "media = np.mean(pesos)\n",
        "print(f\"Média: {media:.2f}\")\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "8ZwrzQGMFYWs",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "outputId": "2f33c873-7767-4a6c-bec6-3544790fa1fe"
      },
      "execution_count": 39,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Média: 1.60\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "## 2. Determine a variância amostral\n",
        "\n",
        "variancia = np.var(pesos, ddof=1)\n",
        "print(f\"Variância: {variancia:.3f}\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "-MVk4aEzLDGt",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
